<title>CHILE: Santa Isabel reports higher Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Santa Isabel reports higher Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean supermarket chain</p>
<p>Santa Isabel reported the following results for the</p>
<p>first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>				 Q1 1997		   Q1 1996</p>
<p> Net profit		    3.4			 2.5</p>
<p> Operating profit	    4.2			 3.2</p>
<p> Non-operating profit     48 million	loss 229 million</p>
<p> Total revenues	     82.8			73.4</p>
<p>NOTE - All figures in billions of Chilean pesos except were noted.</p>
<p>((--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211))</p>
</text>
